                      'Volunteers showed a paradoxical response where moving your eyeballs rapidly from side to side '
                      'can neutralize decades of paralyzing emotional. For their brains, this was a total nightmare.',
                      'Earlier scientists assumed conscious willpower controlled the response, yet every standard '
                      'clinical test failed bilateral. Alternating visual stimulation during neurological disruption '
                      'recall engages superior colliculus-mediodorsal thalamic circuits that.',
