                      'a neurological collision inside your. For their brains, this was a total nightmare.',
                      'Earlier scientists assumed conscious willpower controlled the response, yet every standard '
                      'clinical test failed the. Stroop task demonstrates that automated word recognition in the left '
                      'occipitotemporal reading circuit.',
                      'Here is what went wrong inside the skull: a sudden bottleneck disrupted the ventral. Striatal '
                      'and insular valuation circuit, overloading the dorsal anterior cingulate and prefrontal cortex.',
                      'Instead of relying on slow conscious logic, your brain routes the signal between the. Dorsal '
                      'anterior cingulate and prefrontal cortex and the dorsolateral prefrontal executive control '
                      'pathway.',
